  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b7f5be794788a86acd2c2c7c7a97c1347686e1ce807c6c29a7f28dcde0668976.png] \n\nGiven equation: **28 + 12 - 6 × 40 ÷ 8 = 46**\n\nNow, let's check each option,\n\n1) **× and -**\n\n→ 28 + 12 × 6 - **40 ÷ 8** = 46\n\n→ 28 + **12 ****×**** 6** - 5 = 46\n\n→ **28 + 72** - 5 = 46\n\n→ 100 - 5 ≠ 46\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**</p&g",
